# CODEOWNERS — routes PR review requests to simulated domain teams (REPO-03, D-07).
#
# GitHub uses the LAST matching pattern in this file, not the most specific
# one — so this file is deliberately ordered broad -> specific: a root
# default, then the workflow directory, then increasingly specific
# per-service paths. Every owner below must be one of the six team slugs
# governance/teams.tf creates (verified against
# `gh api /orgs/AuraBit/teams --jq '.[].slug'` before this file was written)
# and must match character-for-character or GitHub silently drops the
# routing for that path without any error.

# Root default owner — anything not matched more specifically below falls
# to team-platform.
* @AuraBit/team-platform

# Workflow-injection defense: the team that owns the pipeline is the only
# team that can change what the pipeline runs. Kept as its own rule (not
# folded into the root default) so it stays correct even if a more specific
# rule below is ever mis-ordered.
/.github/ @AuraBit/team-platform

# --- Per-service ownership -------------------------------------------------
#
# NOTE: Phase 3 creates these service directories — they do not exist in
# this monorepo yet. Declaring the routing ahead of the code is deliberate
# (REPO-03's flagged assumption in 01-05-PLAN.md): the review-routing rules
# must be in place before the first service lands, not retrofitted after.
# Paths follow Online Boutique's own src/<service>/ layout, which Phase 3's
# fork preserves.

# team-storefront: frontend, adservice, recommendationservice
/src/frontend/ @AuraBit/team-storefront
/src/adservice/ @AuraBit/team-storefront
/src/recommendationservice/ @AuraBit/team-storefront

# team-commerce: cartservice, checkoutservice, paymentservice, shippingservice
/src/cartservice/ @AuraBit/team-commerce
/src/checkoutservice/ @AuraBit/team-commerce
/src/paymentservice/ @AuraBit/team-commerce
/src/shippingservice/ @AuraBit/team-commerce

# team-catalog: productcatalogservice, currencyservice
/src/productcatalogservice/ @AuraBit/team-catalog
/src/currencyservice/ @AuraBit/team-catalog

# team-comms: emailservice, loadgenerator
/src/emailservice/ @AuraBit/team-comms
/src/loadgenerator/ @AuraBit/team-comms

# team-media: the custom Go media service (Postgres + S3 uploads + Redis sessions)
/src/media/ @AuraBit/team-media
